1
00:01:09,039 --> 00:01:10,120
I never expected

2
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:12,880
to be raising the biological daughter

3
00:01:12,880 --> 00:01:14,840
of the richest man in Rongcheng.

4
00:01:15,520 --> 00:01:17,760
How do you think Master He

5
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:19,400
should thank me?

6
00:01:20,600 --> 00:01:21,920
Did

7
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:24,200
Madam He come to you?

8
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:25,240
Yes.

9
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:27,160
If she hadn't told me,

10
00:01:27,520 --> 00:01:28,440
how would I know?

11
00:01:28,440 --> 00:01:30,970
You really moved up
in the world, little girl,

12
00:01:31,039 --> 00:01:34,520
turning from a sparrow into a phoenix.

13
00:01:36,560 --> 00:01:38,420
You don't deserve to be my father.

14
00:01:38,440 --> 00:01:40,770
You don't even deserve to be called human.

15
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:45,330
Who's there?

16
00:02:29,480 --> 00:02:30,280
Sorry

17
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:32,600
I'm late.

18
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:39,160
You're safe now.

19
00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:45,160
Our plan was flawless,

20
00:02:47,160 --> 00:02:49,680
yet you had to grow a conscience

21
00:02:49,920 --> 00:02:51,920
and tell He Yu to save her.

22
00:03:25,320 --> 00:03:26,440
Lunatic!

23
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:38,360
Watch out!

24
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:41,200
Slow down.

25
00:03:52,160 --> 00:03:53,000
Sister-in-law!

26
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:54,600
Sue He Shi for domestic violence.

27
00:03:54,600 --> 00:03:56,530
Second Brother and I will help you.

28
00:03:56,920 --> 00:03:58,000
Zhangxin,

29
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:00,260
you don't understand.

30
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:02,360
I want to keep my dignity.

31
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:04,200
You'd let him hurt you

32
00:04:04,200 --> 00:04:05,800
for your so-called dignity?

33
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:07,800
What choice do I have?

34
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:20,000
Zhangxin,

35
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:21,920
I'm sorry.

36
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:25,080
I didn't mean to hurt you.

37
00:04:25,080 --> 00:04:27,280
I'm really out of options.

38
00:04:34,159 --> 00:04:35,480
Have you thought about

39
00:04:35,880 --> 00:04:38,880
how He Shi and Zhang Xin will dump you
once they're done with you?

40
00:04:38,880 --> 00:04:40,840
No one will be able to help you then.

41
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:45,520
I can't bear to think about it.

42
00:04:45,520 --> 00:04:47,640
Ever since I was violated,

43
00:04:49,760 --> 00:04:52,120
I couldn't hold my head up around He Shi.

44
00:04:57,080 --> 00:04:59,540
For someone like He Shi
who always gets even,

45
00:05:00,080 --> 00:05:02,000
how did he punish the rapist?

46
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:08,800
We couldn't find him at all.

47
00:05:17,960 --> 00:05:19,820
This criminal was very cautious.

48
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:21,840
He deliberately avoided the cameras,

49
00:05:21,840 --> 00:05:22,840
hid in the bushes,

50
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:24,250
and waited for his prey.

51
00:05:32,520 --> 00:05:33,200
Wait.

52
00:05:35,960 --> 00:05:36,600
Look.

53
00:05:38,400 --> 00:05:39,920
Before Roujing came out,

54
00:05:40,080 --> 00:05:41,680
several girls had passed by,

55
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:42,840
but this criminal

56
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:44,300
didn't make a move.

57
00:05:45,159 --> 00:05:46,000
You mean

58
00:05:47,320 --> 00:05:49,320
he was targeting my sister-in-law?

59
00:06:16,200 --> 00:06:17,160
He's a repeat offender.

60
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:17,960
Who are you?

61
00:06:22,200 --> 00:06:22,840
Who do you think you are?

62
00:06:22,840 --> 00:06:23,560
Let me go!

63
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:24,640
You're suspected of rape.

64
00:06:24,640 --> 00:06:25,960
Come with us

65
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:27,700
to the police station.

66
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:28,680
It wasn't me.

67
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:29,840
I didn't do it.

68
00:06:31,760 --> 00:06:33,120
Yes,

69
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:34,920
someone put me up to this.

70
00:06:44,280 --> 00:06:45,120
Zhang Xin,

71
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:46,680
do you know him?

72
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:11,160
You just finished cheating,

73
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:13,220
and now you're texting your wife.

74
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:15,360
Don't you feel hypocritical?

75
00:07:15,880 --> 00:07:17,160
For men,

76
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:19,800
sex and love can be separated.

77
00:07:25,080 --> 00:07:26,520
What do you mean?

78
00:07:28,440 --> 00:07:29,900
He confessed everything.

79
00:07:30,160 --> 00:07:30,920
Zhang Xin,

80
00:07:31,400 --> 00:07:32,860
do you have anything to say

81
00:07:33,240 --> 00:07:34,770
before the master returns?

82
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:46,080
Mrs. He,

83
00:07:47,880 --> 00:07:49,880
how could you do this to me?

84
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:54,930
I wake up early every day
to wash your feet.

85
00:07:54,960 --> 00:07:57,080
Am I not obedient enough?

86
00:08:01,520 --> 00:08:02,320
Honey.

87
00:08:03,280 --> 00:08:04,080
Honey.

88
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:09,440
Did you really do it?

89
00:08:15,480 --> 00:08:16,160
Do you think

90
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:18,220
the master will believe an outsider?

91
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:20,120
Besides,

92
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:22,200
once this is exposed,

93
00:08:22,760 --> 00:08:25,040
the master will know

94
00:08:25,400 --> 00:08:27,280
you can't have children.

95
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:41,480
You bitch,

96
00:08:42,240 --> 00:08:43,840
seducing men outside

97
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:45,720
and bringing them home.

98
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:47,720
You're going to elope with him,

99
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:48,380
aren't you?

100
00:08:49,520 --> 00:08:51,800
How could you say that about me?

101
00:08:53,280 --> 00:08:54,560
Are you even human?

102
00:08:55,160 --> 00:08:56,920
My sister-in-law is the victim.

103
00:08:56,920 --> 00:08:58,480
Aren't you afraid Dad will find out?

104
00:08:58,480 --> 00:08:59,640
Fine.

105
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:02,040
Go tell the old man if you dare.

106
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:04,600
Better yet, hold a press conference

107
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:06,780
so we can all go down together.

108
00:09:23,560 --> 00:09:24,960
I was worried about your health,

109
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:27,080
so I kept it from you all this time.

110
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:28,120
But Zhang Xin

111
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:29,450
has really gone too far.

112
00:09:29,760 --> 00:09:31,560
She had her adoptive father kidnap me.

113
00:09:31,560 --> 00:09:32,440
Before that,

114
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:34,360
she even had someone rape Shu Roujing.

115
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:35,400
Are you really going to keep

116
00:09:35,400 --> 00:09:37,260
someone like her in the He family?

117
00:09:39,280 --> 00:09:40,320
I know.

118
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:43,120
I'll handle it.

119
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:45,760
Leave me for now.

120
00:09:58,800 --> 00:10:00,130
I'll give you two lists.

121
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:13,600
She was too young then,

122
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:17,680
not knowing that all the gifts of destiny

123
00:10:18,520 --> 00:10:21,160
are secretly priced.
